MEPA&_nc_oc=AdqYhd_wUc7dSsRd6fAhi4xTHFnh-coFWe--HHtvIBMLDPsH9BQ1NEPP6LAI-ZIUG28&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKJCTBnVwQwz3rJUziuHK6DqHfb8FhwJH5XzNEbEuLPLQ&oe=6AA94DC8"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "708977614588076", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75488375_708977617921409_1075715276216507772_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k6Ln4MEbhYYQ7kNvwGtng6D&_nc_oc=AdoStvH_TqJb8ecd0kz83y4Nrhv8XCnsdfOS9pA8trRr4uY2debGOdhSxAuFCkVC4qY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLquiZ-1lt-0g3hhLRYmGseMLCD7HiM-28It_MzGU4hNg&oe=6AA93F0A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "1449100632372768", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031502_1449100635706101_8566828919912654030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-fESlmrPmOsQ7kNvwFv3xSr&_nc_oc=AdomCZ3K2LSwegmlT4Cw2gbqMkf8K41CeA9phFqgTdrV3qtqH_3aj1kXF9aThe3XVvw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLThVA30ETUe7xNiYfXeZaDvOE5YmxrkW3ruNVT_3_F8Q&oe=6AA93F19"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "1042094833579475", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_1042094836912808_4953768684373887112_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jk_wsrlkrEcQ7kNvwHpnYFM&_nc_oc=AdpmhdMQywz4eFIhCqFCVfKNST4hSXj6fF8-qI9nzPhpu4KApuEUmVE_b3k4kfB2jAY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJhm6rXnIJ51d4kmQS7xRZtmuzoTGIuLFGmNCm_JqyH5Q&oe=6AA95600"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_thumb.png", "id": "889483612519314", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974858_889483615852647_6939535896939341857_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2AH7TH76CswQ7kNvwEshAEp&_nc_oc=AdqtlEden4fvKfzuphe5kmkP9khQwcCv9thmOjIpckpYxSSL8njarTet5l_fx47K4-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJYN1m0DIg33KbIHrQ0eBsQ65AMpmXrHX4dcVXP_7LIFw&oe=6AA9639B"}, "display_name": "Tabletop Basketball AR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\"Tabletop Basketball AR\" for Oculus Quest stands out as an avant-garde blend of traditional basketball gameplay and cutting-edge augmented reality (AR) technology. This game offers players an immersive experience that transforms any tabletop into a dynamic 3-on-3 basketball arena. It ingeniously combines the physical skill and strategy of basketball with the interactive capabilities of AR, providing a gaming experience like no other.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Dynamic AR Gameplay: Turn any tabletop into a basketball court with immersive AR technology.\n- Multiplayer Viewing Experience: Join games within the same environment.\n- Intuitive Controls: Designed for Oculus Touch controllers, suitable for all skill levels.\n- Realistic Graphics and Sound: High-quality graphics and immersive sound effects enhance the experience.\n- Regular Updates: Continuous game improvements and new content based on player feedback.\n\t\nWhat sets this game apart is its remarkable use of AR technology. The game transforms any flat surface into a virtual basketball court, allowing players to move around and view the game from multiple angles. This feature not only adds a layer of realism to the gameplay but also brings an innovative twist to the traditional sports gaming genre.", "short_description": "\"Tabletop Basketball AR\" is an Oculus Quest game that merges the excitement of basketball with augmented reality. In this 3-on-3 basketball game, players experience a full-fledged basketball match, enjoying the thrill of the court from a unique, tabletop perspective. The game offers an immersive, interactive experience, combining the strategy and skill of basketball with the innovative technology of AR, perfect for both sports enthusiasts and gamers seeking a novel gaming experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.redzonestudios.com/privacy", "developer_term